<article
  class="intent-field"
  data-route-production="contact"
  data-route-architecture="intent-field"
  data-route-motion="static"
  aria-labelledby="contact-title"
>
  <section
    class="contact-arrival"
    data-route-act="arrival"
    data-route-region="arrival"
    aria-labelledby="contact-title"
  >
    <header class="ct-opening">
      <p class="ct-k">contact / intent</p>
      <h1 id="contact-title">Start with the challenge.</h1>
      <p class="ct-intro">Choose the path that best matches your reason for speaking with Quantum.</p>
      <nav class="ct-index" aria-label="Contact intent paths">
        <a href="#for-industry"><span>01</span>For industry</a>
        <a href="#for-startups"><span>02</span>For startups / technology</a>
        <a href="#general"><span>03</span>General / ecosystem / media</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="ct-field" data-route-geometry="aligned-intent-rails">
      <div class="ct-heading">
        <p class="ct-k">intent paths</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="contact-paths-title">Three useful starting points.</h2>
          <p>Start with an industrial challenge, a technology introduction or a broader ecosystem conversation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="ct-rails" aria-labelledby="contact-paths-title">
        <li id="for-industry" tabindex="-1">
          <span class="ct-i">01 / challenge</span>
          <div>
            <h3>For industry</h3>
            <p>Begin with the operational need, its context and what a useful test should answer.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li id="for-startups" tabindex="-1">
          <span class="ct-i">02 / technology</span>
          <div>
            <h3>For startups / technology</h3>
            <p>Begin with the capability, industrial use case, readiness and conditions you can support.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li id="general" tabindex="-1">
          <span class="ct-i">03 / network</span>
          <div>
            <h3>General / ecosystem / media</h3>
            <p>Use this context for institutional, ecosystem or media conversations that do not fit the first two paths.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p class="ct-note">No direct contact destination is currently available.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
